},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யோன்","tr":"yōṉ"}]},{"text":"குன்றே","tr":"kuṉṟē","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"குன்","tr":"kuṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றே","tr":"ṟē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"ஈண்டு","parts":[{"text":"ஈண்டு","lemma":"ஈண்டு","gloss":"here"}],"gloss":"here"},{"surface":"நின்றோர்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"நின்றோர்க்கும்","lemma":"நின்றோர்க்கும்","gloss":"even to those who stood"}],"gloss":"even to those who stood","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்று","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"appear"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"habitual future marker"}],"gloss":"appears"},{"surface":"சிறு","parts":[{"text":"சிறு","lemma":"சிறு","gloss":"small"}],"gloss":"small"},{"surface":"வரை","parts":[{"text":"வரை","lemma":"வரை","gloss":"mountain/slope"}],"gloss":"mountain"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"சென்று","parts":[{"text":"சென்று","lemma":"சென்று","gloss":"having gone"}],"gloss":"having gone","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நின்றோர்க்கும்","parts":[{"text":"நின்றோர்க்கும்","lemma":"நின்றோர்க்கும்","gloss":"even to those who stood"}],"gloss":"even to those who stood","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தோன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்று","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"appear"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"habitual future marker"}],"gloss":"appears"},{"surface":"மன்ற","parts":[{"text":"மன்ற","lemma":"மன்ற","gloss":"surely/indeed"}],"gloss":"surely"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"களிறு","parts":[{"text":"களிறு","lemma":"களிறு","gloss":"male elephant"}],"gloss":"male elephant"},{"surface":"மென்று","parts":[{"text":"மென்று","lemma":"மென்று","gloss":"having chewed"}],"gloss":"having chewed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இட்ட","parts":[{"text":"இட்ட","lemma":"இட்ட","gloss":"thrown"}],"gloss":"thrown","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கவளம்","parts":[{"text":"கவளம்","lemma":"கவளம்","gloss":"mouthful of food"}],"gloss":"mouthful of food"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல்","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"resemble"},{"text":"அ","lemma":"அ","gloss":"infinitive suffix"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நறவு","parts":[{"text":"நறவு","lemma":"நறவு","gloss":"sweet wine/toddy"}],"gloss":"sweet wine"},{"surface":"பிழிந்து","parts":[{"text":"பிழிந்து","lemma":"பிழிந்து","gloss":"having squeezed"}],"gloss":"having squeezed","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"இட்ட","parts":[{"text":"இட்ட","lemma":"இட்ட","gloss":"thrown"}],"gloss":"thrown","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கோது","parts":[{"text":"கோது","lemma":"கோது","gloss":"dregs/pulp"}],"gloss":"dregs"},{"surface":"உடை","parts":[{"text":"உடை","lemma":"உடை","gloss":"possessing"}],"gloss":"possessing"},{"surface":"சிதறல்","parts":[{"text":"சிதறு","lemma":"சிதறு","gloss":"scatter"},{"text":"அல்","lemma":"அல்","gloss":"verbal noun suffix"}],"gloss":"scattered residue"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வார்","parts":[{"text":"வார்","lemma":"வார்","gloss":"flow/long"}],"gloss":"flowing"},{"surface":"அசும்பு","parts":[{"text":"அசும்பு","lemma":"அசும்பு","gloss":"moisture/spring"}],"gloss":"moisture"},{"surface":"ஒழுகு","parts":[{"text":"ஒழுகு","lemma":"ஒழுகு","gloss":"trickle/flow"}],"gloss":"trickling"},{"surface":"முன்றில்","parts":[{"text":"முன்றில்","lemma":"முன்றில்","gloss":"courtyard"}],"gloss":"courtyard"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தேர்","parts":[{"text":"தேர்","lemma":"தேர்","gloss":"chariot"}],"gloss":"chariots"},{"surface":"வீசு","parts":[{"text":"வீசு","lemma":"வீசு","gloss":"fling/bestow generously"}],"gloss":"bestowing"},{"surface":"இருக்கை","parts":[{"text":"இரு","lemma":"இரு","gloss":"sit"},{"text":"க்கை","lemma":"இருக்கை","gloss":"seat/presence"}],"gloss":"presence"},{"surface":"நெடியோன்","parts":[{"text":"நெடியோன்","lemma":"நெடியோன்","gloss":"the great patron"}],"gloss":"the great patron","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"குன்றே","parts":[{"text":"குன்று","lemma":"குன்று","gloss":"hill"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphasis particle"}],"gloss":"is the hill indeed"}]}],"literal":"To those standing here, it appears as a small range / To those who have gone and stood far, it appears indeed / Like the mouthful of food chewed and thrown by a male elephant / Like the scattered dregs of squeezed sweet wine / In the courtyard where flowing moisture trickles / Of the great patron whose presence bestowed chariots, is the hill indeed.","translation":"To those who stand close by, it appears as a small ridge. To those who go far away and look, it is still clearly visible. The hill of the great patron, in whose courtyard moisture trickled like the chewed food-balls dropped by elephants and the scattered dregs of squeezed sweet wine, and who sat generously gifting chariots, still stands there for all to see.","modern":"இங்கே அருகில் நின்று பார்ப்பவர்களுக்கும் ஒரு சிறிய குன்றாகத் தோன்றும்; தொலைவில் சென்று நின்று பார்ப்பவர்களுக்கும் நிச்சயமாகத் தோன்றும். ஆண் யானை மென்று உதிர்த்த உணவுத் திரளைப் போலவும், மதுவைப் பிழிந்து எறிந்த சக்கையின் சிதறலைப் போலவும், நீர் வடியும் முற்றம் கொண்டதும், தேர்களை வாரி வழங்கிய இருக்கையைக் கொண்டதுமான அந்தப் பெருமகனாகிய பாரியின் குன்றானது இன்றும் அப்படியே காட்சியளிக்கிறது.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the potuviyal tiṇai and is a lament (kaiyaṟunilai) by the poet Kapilar on the death of his close friend and patron, King Vēḷ Pāri. The poet expresses deep grief by contrasting the transience of human life with the permanence of nature. He notes that while Pāri is gone, his famous Parampu hill remains visible to everyone, whether they stand near or far. The courtyard of Pāri's palace is described with vivid imagery of past abundance, where moisture trickled amidst the chewed food dropped by royal elephants and the discarded dregs of squeezed sweet wine. Through these sensory details, the poet highlights the immense wealth and generosity of the great patron who once sat there gifting chariots.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.6],[0.6,0.8],[0.8,1.3],[1.3,1.7],[1.7,2.0],[2.0,2.2],[2.2,3.1],[3.1,3.3],[3.3,3.5],[3.5,4.2],[4.2,4.4],[4.4,5.4],[5.